# ── Playlist-coherence research lane (2026-08-19) ────────────────────
# The analysis SOURCE is committed (scripts/radio_utils.py, playlist_selector.py,
# markov_analysis.py, export_graph.py, app.py, playlist_explorer.py, and the two
# docs/*.md write-ups). The derived data below is regenerable from the mirror and
# stays out of git for the same reason docs/data/ does - it is data, not source.
#
# The HTML pages are local-only for now: they fetch the JSON with relative paths,
# so publishing them would ship four pages that render empty. Finishing them means
# uploading the JSON to the public storage bucket and switching the pages to BASE
# fetches - see docs/README-playlist-selector.md ("Data pipeline").
/docs/graph-*.json
/docs/markov-graph-*.json
/docs/playlist-candidates-all.json
/docs/playlist-explorer.html
/docs/cooccurrence-graph.html
/docs/markov-graph.html
/docs/soundcloud.html
